{{Quote|I've retaken Hold 6, Captain. The cargo is gone.|DT-F16|<ref name="ITNOR" />}}
'''Hold 6''' was a cargo hold on [[Orca-class freighter|''Orca''-class freighter]], [[Freighter 2716]]. It contained a massive [[Kyber crystal]] and was guarded by [[Death trooper]], [[DT-F16]] and her [[DT-F16's squad|squad]].<ref name="ITNOR" />

==History==
{{Quote|Captain, rebels lead by Saw Gerrera have breached Hold 6 and taken posession of the cargo.|DT-F16|<ref name="ITNOR" />}}
In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Chronology Note" /> DT-F16 and her squad of Death troopers were tasked with guarding a large Kyber crystal inside of Hold 6. The ship was boarded by [[Saw Gerrera]], [[Ezra Bridger]], [[Sabine Wren]], and [[C1-10P|Chopper]], who entered the cargo hold and began firing upon the Death troopers inside, forcing them to retreat. DT-F16 returned with reinforcements, but found that the cargo was gone; the rebels having moved to the engine room and set it to explode. Hold 6 was destroyed, along with the rest of Freighter 2716 when the Kyber crystal exploded.<ref name="ITNOR" />

